## Run

```bash
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
alembic upgrade head          # create the schema
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 4200
```

## Layout

```
app/
  main.py               # entry point — YOURS to extend (written once)
  generated/            # owned by Backbone — regenerated wholesale, do not edit
    core/               # config, db session, security
    models/             # SQLAlchemy models
    schemas/            # Pydantic v2 (camelCase alias)
    services/           # business layer
    routers/            # APIRouters (only detected endpoints)
<% if (auth) { %>    auth/               # register / login / me + JWT dependency
<% } %>    alembic/            # migration environment (env.py)
migrations/             # additive Alembic revisions — never edited or deleted
```

Everything under `app/generated/` is overwritten on regenerate. `app/main.py` is yours.

